OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 18 MAY
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GThis week, London-based drummer,
OL,12,     Gpercussionist and bandleader Jas
OL,13,     GKayser is sitting in for Soweto
OL,14,     GKinch, sharing some exciting jazz
OL,15,     Greleases from the UK and around
OL,16,     Gthe world.
